      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I am Saurabh K., and this is my first week working with brutalist dot art, the video toolkit I was assigned. One note before we start. The voice you are hearing is A I generated. The work, the commits and the films are mine. Here is what I set out to find.",
