    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "EVIDENCE",
      "narration_text": "Here is what actually came out of the week. Two explainers, each one in widescreen and in vertical. M C P, Explained, at two forty one. Agents, On Their Own, at two fourteen. Four finished masters, every one of them built the same way.",
